        "original_id": "57b69817-6b12-55bf-95f3-f608ecabdd83",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lauren London, Chris Robinson, Dana Verde, Brandon Broussard, Gary Hardwick, Terrence J, Cassie Ventura, Paula Patton, Big Boi\n- Works: ATL, The Perfect Match, 90210, Entourage, The Game, Git Up, Git Out\n- Roles: actress, model, television personality, director, writer\n\nFacts:\n- Lauren London was born on December 5, 1984, and she is an American film actress, model, television personality, and occasional television actress.\n- ATL is a 2006 American comedy-drama film and the feature film directorial debut of Chris Robinson.\n- Lauren London earned recognition for her performance in the 2006 film ATL after beginning her career in music videos and later transitioning into film and television acting.\n- The track Git Up, Git Out was featured in the 2006 film ATL, which also featured Big Boi.\n- Lauren London also became known for appearing in the television shows 90210 and Entourage and for playing Kiera Whitaker on the BET comedy-drama The Game.\n- The Perfect Match is a 2016 film written by Dana Verde, Brandon Broussard, and Gary Hardwick, and it stars Terrence J, Cassie Ventura, Lauren London, and Paula Patton.",
